      "message": "If we find a way to trigger verity node digest block in advance and invent a new clever way to arrange such tail digest block close to the fs metadata in a fs-metadata-independent way, that would be much better to apply intrusive modification to EROFS_INODE_FLAT_PLAIN and EROFS_INODE_COMPRESSED_FULL since EROFS_INODE_COMPRESSED_COMPACT is common for small pclusters (and many android users) and EROFS_INODE_CHUNK_BASED is used for some container images for example.",
